1
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,040
What happened?

2
00:01:26,799 --> 00:01:27,200
She drank too much.

3
00:01:27,359 --> 00:01:27,879
I tore it.

4
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:33,040
What happened at the banquet yesterday?

5
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:34,920
You told me

6
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,439
to take orders for the escort agency.

7
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,719
But I couldn't fit in at all yesterday.

8
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,319
Zhang Xiayun

9
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,599
is a real beauty,

10
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,439
while I

11
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,719
am a real ugly.

12
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:47,120
She's better than me in everything.

13
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:48,519
I can't hold back

14
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:50,120
a girl who wants to be a phoenix.

15
00:01:52,319 --> 00:01:53,319
So you've stuck it?

16
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:54,159
Yes.

17
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,040
How can I divorce him without a divorce paper?

18
00:01:56,319 --> 00:01:57,799
We're about to break up.

19
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,280
He insisted that

20
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,400
I promised to help him with the speech yesterday.

21
00:02:04,079 --> 00:02:04,959
He's dreaming.

22
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:05,840
No.

23
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,680
You have to prepare for the final interview with him.

24
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:12,759
You must shine in front of Zhang Xi Yun.

25
00:02:14,479 --> 00:02:15,759
This is called tit for tat.

26
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,240
Why are you the only one who is not happy?

27
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:19,840
But

28
00:02:19,879 --> 00:02:21,719
You don't mean

29
00:02:21,919 --> 00:02:22,919
to give up, do you?

30
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:24,479
Give up?

31
00:02:24,759 --> 00:02:25,879
I will give up?

32
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,599
Su Yuejiao will never give up.

33
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:29,479
That's right.

34
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,639
Su's Escort Agency

35
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,159
is always with the escort.

36
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,879
So I'll keep this for you first.

37
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:37,919
In case you tear it again.

38
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:44,840
Yesterday,

39
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,919
you favored Cheng Qi at the banquet.

40
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:48,400
Today,

41
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:50,319
the complaint was brought to me.

42
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,039
It was my negligence.

43
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,360
I didn't let Mr. Ling win the competition.

44
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,439
I'll be more careful

45
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:57,280
in the final.

46
00:02:58,599 --> 00:03:01,159
You can fool Qi Jia with that,

47
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,800
but not me.

48
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:05,240
I'm sorry.

49
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,120
Why?

50
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,120
I know I was wrong.

51
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:12,599
I don't care about the winner.

52
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,639
They're all pawns.

53
00:03:14,919 --> 00:03:16,039
Whoever you pick,

54
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:17,840
you must control them

55
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,520
and handle the consequences.

56
00:03:21,199 --> 00:03:22,960
Don't let me clean up your mess.

57
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:24,199
Yes.

58
00:03:25,479 --> 00:03:27,319
The Queen has assigned Yue Shangzhi

59
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:28,840
to attend the final.

60
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,319
So whatever you want to do,

61
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,439
you must do it cleanly.

62
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,960
Am I clear enough?

63
00:03:41,199 --> 00:03:42,000
Yes.

64
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:51,919
My Lady,

65
00:03:52,719 --> 00:03:54,280
did the Lord take out his anger on you?

66
00:03:55,159 --> 00:03:56,080
Not only not,

67
00:03:56,639 --> 00:03:58,159
he even gave me a sword.

68
00:04:09,719 --> 00:04:12,080
Tang Xin's music is ready.

69
00:04:12,759 --> 00:04:13,240
Faca,

70
00:04:14,039 --> 00:04:16,639
you're in charge of controlling the rhythm and brightness of the shadow.

71
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,120
Qian,

72
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,519
the props of the scenery are up to you.

73
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,160
Okay.

74
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:22,839
Gong Xi,

75
00:04:22,959 --> 00:04:23,920
you help Qian.

76
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:24,600
Okay, my son-in-law.

77
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:27,399
Jiao.

78
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:28,720
You just play yourself.

79
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:30,480
This is your story.

80
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,399
I can't believe my boss agreed.

81
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,680
He's even full of fighting spirit.

82
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,360
Why is mine so thick?

83
00:06:25,959 --> 00:06:28,240
Today is the final of the Starry Sky Literary Awards.

84
00:06:28,639 --> 00:06:31,199
Not only do we have several literary masters participating in the selection,

85
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:34,079
but also Mr. Yue from the Ministry of Rites overseeing the event.

86
00:06:34,759 --> 00:06:37,120
I'm sure the competition will be spectacular.

87
00:06:37,639 --> 00:06:38,680
The first round of the final

88
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,439
the first round,

89
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,959
the keywords are

90
00:06:41,199 --> 00:06:43,279
heart, cloud, flower, and moon.

91
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,879
The heart, after drawing lots,

92
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,759
will be started by Mr. Cheng.

93
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,519
Please.

94
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,160
I remember the first time I met you,

95
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,040
you were wearing a double-layered silk dress.

96
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:12,279
I am like a magnetized needle,

97
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:15,000
pointing to the south.

98
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,319
The heart of a guest competes with the sun and moon,

99
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,959
anticipating the journey.

100
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,519
If I don't write poetry for a day,

101
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:24,759
my heart becomes like a dry well.

102
00:07:24,959 --> 00:07:26,279
The shadow is upright because it is straight.

103
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:28,000
The heart is strong and lazy to hide its edge.

104
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,759
Flowers never end, the moon is endless.

105
00:07:32,879 --> 00:07:34,560
Two hearts are the same.

106
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,199
Cloud.

107
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,879
The bright moon idly leans by the water.

108
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:49,439
White clouds invite guests to climb higher.

109
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:53,079
The autumn wind rises, and the white clouds fly.

110
00:07:53,199 --> 00:07:55,959
The grass and trees turn yellow, and the wild geese return south.

111
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:58,800
Layer upon layer of peach and plum blossoms on the mountain.

112
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:01,399
The smoke and fire in the clouds are the homes of people.

113
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:01,959
Hua.

114
00:08:02,079 --> 00:08:03,759
The flower does not bloom with the hundred flowers.

115
00:08:03,759 --> 00:08:06,319
Standing alone in the sparse fence, its charm is endless.

116
00:08:06,759 --> 00:08:08,360
How can one bear to see the painting change its colors?

117
00:08:08,519 --> 00:08:10,519
How can one allow the rivers and mountains to turn to ashes?

118
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,360
The jade bowl is cold with dew,

119
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,120
The fragrance of snow permeates the gauze.

120
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:16,120
The hall is fragrant with incense.

121
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:18,560
The waist is slim and delicate.

122
00:08:19,759 --> 00:08:21,279
What a talent!

123
00:08:24,399 --> 00:08:26,079
The clear and elegant temperament is suitable for a guest.

124
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:28,439
The tranquil and silent temperament is suitable for a king.

125
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:28,920
The moon.

126
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:42,159
The moon is so beautiful that it brings a different atmosphere.

127
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:45,080
The moon is so precious that it is worth a fortune.

128
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,320
The moon is so kind that it knows my feelings.

129
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,919
I can't bear to see the moon at its fullest tonight.

130
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:50,960
Who is as affectionate as the moon of the South Mountain?

131
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,159
It parts the evening clouds on purpose.

132
00:09:04,039 --> 00:09:06,480
Who pushed the bright moon

133
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:09,879
up into the sky?

134
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:16,440
The moonlight is like water after parting.

135
00:09:16,639 --> 00:09:19,759
I miss you every night.

136
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:23,879
The moon accompanies me on my journey.

137
00:09:24,399 --> 00:09:27,519
Its light falls on my quilt in a strange land.

138
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:10,960
The first round of the flying flower order ends here.

139
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,039
It's a great honor to see all the talented individuals

140
00:10:13,039 --> 00:10:14,639
perform so wonderfully.

141
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,399
The results are out.

142
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,080
The talents who have entered the middle round are

143
00:10:18,639 --> 00:10:20,159
Ling Feng, Mr. Ling,

144
00:10:25,399 --> 00:10:26,879
Cheng Qi, Mr. Cheng,

145
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,559
Xin Bufang, Mr. Xin.

146
00:10:32,879 --> 00:10:34,639
Please take a break.

147
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,960
We will draw lots to determine the order for the next round.

148
00:10:40,399 --> 00:10:41,879
Lord Yue, Miss Zhang,

149
00:10:43,519 --> 00:10:45,360
I am willing to go first in this round,

150
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:47,840
to give other talents more time to prepare.

151
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,559
Mr. Ling, you are so kind.

152
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,440
Mr. Ling, you volunteer to go first.

153
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:52,960
Please get ready, Mr. Ling.

154
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:21,840
He did it on purpose.

155
00:12:22,399 --> 00:12:23,399
It's all acting.

156
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:25,320
He's not novel.

157
00:12:26,279 --> 00:12:27,559
Although it's all acting,

158
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:28,840
we have a trump card.

159
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:30,919
What's the trump card?

160
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:31,919
Why don't I know?

161
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:34,039
Jiao, don't think about it.

162
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:35,519
Later,

163
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,840
just pretend it's your dream

164
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:37,559
to meet your mother.

165
00:12:58,159 --> 00:13:00,679
Good, good.

166
00:13:00,679 --> 00:13:01,559
Very good.

167
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:09,960
It's beautiful,

168
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,840
but lacks power.

169
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,399
Next, please welcome Cheng Qi.

170
00:13:16,399 --> 00:13:17,399
Mr. Cheng.

171
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,600
Go for it, my son-in-law!

172
00:13:47,759 --> 00:13:48,240
Mom,

173
00:13:48,639 --> 00:13:49,879
is this the City of Diamond?

174
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:51,360
It's different from Yunjing.

175
00:13:51,799 --> 00:13:52,759
Isn't it beautiful?

176
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,480
Are you escorts from Yunjing?

177
00:13:57,679 --> 00:13:58,879
You must be tired.

178
00:14:00,159 --> 00:14:00,639
Mom,

179
00:14:01,639 --> 00:14:03,200
their accent is so strange.

180
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:04,679
They are

181
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:06,679
Langyue people doing business in the Yun State.

182
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,840
So does he find our accent

183
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,039
strange too?

184
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:11,279
No, no,

185
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:13,639
your accent is very pleasant.

186
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:18,240
Hope everything goes well for you here.

187
00:14:34,559 --> 00:14:35,120
Jiao,

188
00:14:36,639 --> 00:14:38,080
I hid a chicken leg in the cart.

189
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:39,639
Go find it.

190
00:14:40,639 --> 00:14:42,519
Mom, you always do this.

191
00:14:42,759 --> 00:14:44,840
You always tell me after I'm full.

192
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,159
Su's Escort Agency.

193
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:54,879
We'll protect the goods with our lives.

194
00:15:39,679 --> 00:15:41,559
Mom, the drumstick is so delicious.

195
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,399
I'm leaving.

196
00:15:48,639 --> 00:15:49,480
Jiao,

197
00:15:50,519 --> 00:15:51,960
you should continue your journey

198
00:15:52,799 --> 00:15:55,000
and see all the beauty of the Yun State for me.

199
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,240
Mom!

200
00:17:40,079 --> 00:17:40,880
Mom,

201
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:43,720
I've seen it for you.

202
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:48,200
The Yun State is becoming more and more beautiful.

203
00:18:28,839 --> 00:18:31,759
That's great.

204
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,759
Immersed in it.

205
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:53,119
Who is Cheng Qi?

206
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:55,039
The son of the deputy of Ning'an County.

207
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:05,440
According to the scores of all the guests,

208
00:19:05,599 --> 00:19:08,279
the champion of this Star Conference is

209
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:14,759
Cheng Qi.

210
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:26,160
I thought he was extraordinary from the first round.

211
00:19:28,759 --> 00:19:31,279
He deserves to be the champion.

212
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:32,200
Yeah.

213
00:19:41,799 --> 00:19:42,319
Congratulations!

214
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,559
I'll always remember

215
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:45,599
your recognition.

216
00:19:49,799 --> 00:19:51,839
Cloud Book Bureau and Huayue Tower

217
00:19:51,839 --> 00:19:53,319
will join forces with the top scholar

218
00:19:53,799 --> 00:19:56,920
to add luster to the prosperous Yun State.

219
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:16,880
My lord, are we still going according to the plan?

220
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:17,519
Of course.

221
00:20:17,759 --> 00:20:18,160
My lord,

222
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:19,839
we'll go back and prepare.

223
00:20:20,519 --> 00:20:20,880
Go.

224
00:20:20,880 --> 00:20:21,400
Okay.

225
00:20:24,799 --> 00:20:25,480
Let's go, Qianzhi.

226
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:27,680
Aren't we waiting for Cheng Qi?

227
00:20:27,759 --> 00:20:29,200
Didn't we want to give him a surprise?

228
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,440
Of course, we should let them be alone at this time.

229
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:32,119
Of course, we should let them be alone at this time.

230
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:32,599
Right, right.

231
00:20:32,599 --> 00:20:34,759
Let's go, go home.

232
00:20:41,359 --> 00:20:44,359
My father has prepared a banquet at home to celebrate.

233
00:20:45,359 --> 00:20:46,440
Since the Grand Preceptor has invited,

234
00:20:46,759 --> 00:20:47,759
we must attend.

235
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:49,359
Miss Zhang,

236
00:20:49,720 --> 00:20:51,319
I need to inform my family.

237
00:20:51,799 --> 00:20:53,000
I've already sent someone to inform them.

238
00:20:58,440 --> 00:21:00,559
I thought you would want to discuss the follow-up of the book

239
00:21:00,559 --> 00:21:01,880
and the recitation meeting.

240
00:21:04,519 --> 00:21:07,119
Could it be that the top scholar

241
00:21:07,759 --> 00:21:10,079
intends to make a living in the escort agency for a lifetime?

242
00:21:12,839 --> 00:21:15,079
If so, I'll bother you.

243
00:21:25,119 --> 00:21:26,759
Why are you still here, Mr. Su?

244
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:29,920
Mr. Cheng went to the banquet with my lady.

245
00:21:33,319 --> 00:21:34,359
A banquet?

246
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:36,559
And he didn't even tell me.

247
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:54,519
Eat.

248
00:22:10,960 --> 00:22:13,880
He just won the top of the Star Cloud Competition and disappeared.

249
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:15,240
It makes sense.

250
00:22:15,880 --> 00:22:17,480
The food at the Grand Preceptor's Mansion

251
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:19,440
is much better than ours.

252
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:20,680
Don't wait.

253
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:21,759
Let's eat.

254
00:22:22,839 --> 00:22:23,920
The food at home is not good.

255
00:22:25,039 --> 00:22:25,720
You don't eat it.

256
00:22:29,799 --> 00:22:30,960
You can't keep your people,

257
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:32,079
why are you mad at me?

258
00:22:32,640 --> 00:22:33,960
I just don't like you today.

259
00:22:34,000 --> 00:22:34,839
You have such a bad temper.

260
00:22:34,839 --> 00:22:36,839
If I were Cheng Qi, I wouldn't return either.

261
00:22:36,839 --> 00:22:37,680
Say that again.

262
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:37,960
I...

263
00:22:38,799 --> 00:22:39,880
Can you stop quarreling all day?

264
00:23:08,759 --> 00:23:11,599
His Majesty is quite interested in this.

265
00:23:12,079 --> 00:23:12,960
He believes that all of you

266
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:15,400
are the future of our nation's literary scene.

267
00:23:16,759 --> 00:23:19,000
If you enter the court,

268
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:21,480
you will make a great contribution.

269
00:23:22,599 --> 00:23:24,119
As the Grand Preceptor,

270
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:25,440
you are willing to promote us.

271
00:23:25,559 --> 00:23:27,559
We are so lucky.

272
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:30,599
We will respect you

273
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:33,200
and live up to your expectations.

274
00:23:40,759 --> 00:23:41,640
Cheng Qi.

275
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:43,759
Yes.

276
00:23:44,599 --> 00:23:47,519
I remember your father was sidelined.

277
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:51,759
Now he is just a county sheriff.

278
00:23:53,279 --> 00:23:55,559
If you become an official,

279
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:57,240
you'll bring honor to your family.

280
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:02,680
My Lord,

281
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:05,000
I just like writing poems.

282
00:24:05,240 --> 00:24:06,400
I don't want to be an official.

283
00:24:10,039 --> 00:24:10,880
Really?

284
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:13,440
Mr. Cheng is unrestrained and free.

285
00:24:13,799 --> 00:24:15,799
With your talent, you may

286
00:24:16,079 --> 00:24:19,160
bring fortune to the people of the Yun State.

287
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:23,400
If so,

288
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:25,400
then don't force yourself.

289
00:24:27,279 --> 00:24:28,400
Thank you for your appreciation.

290
00:24:29,759 --> 00:24:30,880
Thank you for your compliment.

291
00:24:35,599 --> 00:24:36,119
Come on.

292
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:38,680
Let's drink together.

293
00:24:49,400 --> 00:24:50,759
Burn the bridge after crossing it.

294
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:53,720
You just finished acting,

295
00:24:54,279 --> 00:24:55,079
and then

296
00:24:55,519 --> 00:24:56,759
you ran away with him.

297
00:24:58,400 --> 00:24:59,400
Jiaojiao.

298
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:13,079
It's a banquet hosted by the Grand Preceptor, not a private meeting.

299
00:25:13,599 --> 00:25:14,680
Is it necessary to be so angry?

300
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:15,839
Who said it's because of Cheng Qi?

301
00:25:15,839 --> 00:25:17,079
Who mentioned Cheng Qi?

302
00:25:17,079 --> 00:25:18,079
You're admitting it yourself.

303
00:25:19,200 --> 00:25:20,000
Where he wants to go,

304
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:20,880
who he wants to stay with,

305
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:21,839
has nothing to do with me.

306
00:25:23,160 --> 00:25:23,799
Exactly.

307
00:25:24,079 --> 00:25:25,559
He won the top of the Xingyun competition.

308
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:26,920
You're about to take over as the Grand Secretariat.

309
00:25:27,119 --> 00:25:28,000
Once you two separate,

310
00:25:28,000 --> 00:25:29,079
of course, there's no connection.

311
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:31,359
Xin,

312
00:25:33,799 --> 00:25:34,519
you've hit him

313
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,519
and smashed things.

314
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:36,599
Are you still mad?

315
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:44,359
Instead of being upset and making guesses,

316
00:25:44,559 --> 00:25:46,519
you'd better ask him directly

317
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:49,079
if he wants to stay or go.

318
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:52,079
How do I ask him?

319
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:09,519
You're leaving already?

320
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:14,599
Miss Zhang,

321
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:17,559
thanks for the help at the Starry Night.

322
00:26:18,559 --> 00:26:20,039
I should be grateful.

323
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:22,440
How do you plan to thank me?

324
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,440
These are

325
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:36,279
the lyrics and expanded scripts for my final trial.

326
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,119
I'll give them to you.

327
00:26:38,599 --> 00:26:39,759
These papers

328
00:26:40,799 --> 00:26:42,039
are quite valuable now.

329
00:26:43,759 --> 00:26:45,200
Are you trying to do business with me?

330
00:26:46,079 --> 00:26:48,440
They are valuable because of you.

331
00:26:48,759 --> 00:26:50,039
If you stay in Yunjing in the future,

332
00:26:50,319 --> 00:26:52,160
please help me.

333
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:53,480
Don't worry.

334
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:55,519
I won't forget your contribution.

335
00:26:56,519 --> 00:26:57,880
Are you in such a hurry to leave

336
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:00,599
because of your wife?

337
00:27:02,359 --> 00:27:03,599
I'm sorry to make you laugh.

338
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:05,200
She is actually

339
00:27:05,359 --> 00:27:06,720
a very considerate woman,

340
00:27:07,240 --> 00:27:08,519
not as the rumors say.

341
00:27:09,559 --> 00:27:11,359
You are really a couple of lovebirds.

342
00:27:12,400 --> 00:27:13,920
My wife and I have promised to be together

343
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:16,240
until old age, naturally hoping to help each other.

344
00:27:16,240 --> 00:27:18,440
When true is false, false is true.

345
00:27:20,440 --> 00:27:21,640
It seems that Mr. Cheng

346
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:23,519
has made a fake play real.

347
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:27,079
What are you talking about?

348
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:28,279
I don't understand.

349
00:27:28,759 --> 00:27:30,079
You and Su

350
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:31,880
got married by contract.

351
00:27:34,119 --> 00:27:35,279
You don't have to be surprised.

352
00:27:35,960 --> 00:27:37,319
The leader of Xingyun,

353
00:27:37,880 --> 00:27:39,680
wouldn't I have investigated his background?

354
00:27:43,559 --> 00:27:44,200
Miss Zhang,

355
00:27:45,359 --> 00:27:46,599
as a live-in son-in-law,

356
00:27:46,599 --> 00:27:47,880
if I don't go back,

357
00:27:48,200 --> 00:27:50,160
I'll be kicked out of the house.

358
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:50,920
Don't worry.

359
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,880
You can live in my villa.

360
00:27:53,200 --> 00:27:54,319
I'm afraid to bother you.

361
00:27:54,519 --> 00:27:55,279
I'll take my leave.

362
00:27:58,839 --> 00:27:59,640
Miss,

363
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:02,640
I did see the divorce paper from Tang Xin.

364
00:28:03,359 --> 00:28:05,160
But why is Cheng Qi...

365
00:28:06,000 --> 00:28:07,559
Then we can push them

366
00:28:08,559 --> 00:28:09,880
to divorce.

367
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:21,200
It's like a trap.

368
00:28:21,839 --> 00:28:22,920
I didn't dare to eat anything.

369
00:28:23,720 --> 00:28:25,319
Will there be nothing to eat when we get back?

370
00:28:25,680 --> 00:28:26,359
It won't be that bad.

371
00:28:26,359 --> 00:28:27,519
They will leave some for us.

372
00:28:27,519 --> 00:28:27,839
Let's go.

373
00:29:03,559 --> 00:29:04,599
After the competition,

374
00:29:04,599 --> 00:29:05,960
I was invited to the Grand Preceptor's Mansion.

375
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:07,680
It took me a while to sneak out.

376
00:29:07,680 --> 00:29:09,240
I've flattered you enough for a lifetime.

377
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:18,000
Are you mad at me?

378
00:29:18,599 --> 00:29:20,559
My hands are numb.

379
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:26,279
My hands are numb.

380
00:29:26,559 --> 00:29:28,160
Why don't you go back to sleep?

381
00:29:29,599 --> 00:29:30,279
I'm waiting for you.

382
00:29:31,359 --> 00:29:32,119
Waiting for me?

383
00:29:35,079 --> 00:29:36,599
Aren't you mad at me?

384
00:29:38,079 --> 00:29:39,160
Why would I be mad?

385
00:29:42,680 --> 00:29:45,039
What if I become a successful person

386
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:47,039
and never come back?

387
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:51,200
Are you that kind of person?

388
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:51,839
No.

389
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:56,279
But I'm hungry.

390
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:58,039
Can I have

391
00:29:58,079 --> 00:29:58,920
this chicken leg?

392
00:29:59,039 --> 00:29:59,480
No.

393
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:03,200
Congratulations, son-in-law,

394
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:04,960
on topping the imperial examination.

395
00:30:06,039 --> 00:30:07,000
We've been discussing for a while

396
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:08,480
and decided to wait for you to come back

397
00:30:08,559 --> 00:30:09,440
to celebrate your success.

398
00:30:10,480 --> 00:30:11,599
You've made a great achievement!

399
00:30:12,079 --> 00:30:13,200
You're the top scholar!

400
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:14,880
What a happy family!

401
00:30:15,279 --> 00:30:16,599
You're the best!

402
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:20,000
Delicious!

403
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:21,440
A family

404
00:30:21,599 --> 00:30:23,400
should be together.

405
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:25,200
Come on.

406
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:31,200
Cheng Qi,

407
00:30:31,839 --> 00:30:34,359
you're the best today,

408
00:30:34,359 --> 00:30:35,559
and come out on top?

409
00:30:35,960 --> 00:30:36,599
Grandpa,

410
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:38,720
our son-in-law has always been great.

411
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:40,519
I didn't realize it before,

412
00:30:40,759 --> 00:30:41,960
but today, Cheng Qi really

413
00:30:42,359 --> 00:30:43,519
surprised us all.

414
00:30:43,519 --> 00:30:44,279
Of course.

415
00:30:44,680 --> 00:30:45,799
Although he's still

416
00:30:45,799 --> 00:30:47,160
a bit behind me.

417
00:30:53,599 --> 00:30:54,440
Cheng Qi,

418
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:58,160
I want to toast you separately

419
00:31:00,039 --> 00:31:02,640
Thank you for taking care of Jiaojiao.

420
00:31:03,359 --> 00:31:04,240
Jiaojiao's

421
00:31:04,839 --> 00:31:06,000
parents died early,

422
00:31:06,279 --> 00:31:08,559
and she's been spoiled by me.

423
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:11,640
She's domineering, arrogant,

424
00:31:11,799 --> 00:31:13,559
and does things without thinking of the consequences,

425
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:15,319
like a boy.

426
00:31:16,839 --> 00:31:19,160
Thank you for your understanding and tolerance.

427
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:20,880
At the same time,

428
00:31:21,279 --> 00:31:23,559
welcome to our big family.

429
00:31:27,200 --> 00:31:28,000
Thank you, Grandpa.

430
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:28,880
I toast to you, Grandpa.

431
00:31:29,000 --> 00:31:29,440
Good.

432
00:31:29,599 --> 00:31:30,039
Come on.

433
00:31:30,039 --> 00:31:30,880
I'll join you.

434
00:31:31,279 --> 00:31:32,119
I'll join you.

435
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,160
Then let's drink together.

436
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:33,759
Okay.

437
00:31:33,759 --> 00:31:34,279
Then let's do it together.

438
00:31:34,279 --> 00:31:35,079
Together, together.

439
00:31:35,599 --> 00:31:37,559
Let's toast.

440
00:31:50,480 --> 00:31:52,880
Boss, you drink water so happily.

441
00:31:56,079 --> 00:31:56,400
Come on.

442
00:32:20,160 --> 00:32:21,240
The straw man's arm

443
00:32:21,440 --> 00:32:22,359
has been cut off.

444
00:32:31,400 --> 00:32:34,160
Instead of guessing and getting upset,

445
00:32:34,400 --> 00:32:36,319
you might as well ask him directly

446
00:32:36,519 --> 00:32:39,000
if he wants to stay or go.

447
00:32:47,480 --> 00:32:49,200
[She still cares about the divorce papers.]

448
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:51,359
[I need to hurry up.]

449
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:04,240
I'm going back to Ning'an in a few days.

450
00:33:05,680 --> 00:33:07,200
You won the top scholar,

451
00:33:07,200 --> 00:33:08,759
to confront my parents?

452
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:11,720
I'm buying a house in the capital.

453
00:33:12,200 --> 00:33:12,759
So,

454
00:33:12,759 --> 00:33:14,680
I have to go back and tell them.

455
00:33:16,079 --> 00:33:16,720
Looks like

456
00:33:16,960 --> 00:33:18,240
you're not coming back.

457
00:33:21,440 --> 00:33:22,720
Should I buy the house

458
00:33:23,079 --> 00:33:24,559
near the agency?

459
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:26,160
I can come back for dinner.

460
00:33:27,039 --> 00:33:29,079
You're still thinking about dinner

461
00:33:29,440 --> 00:33:30,119
Cheng Qi,

462
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:31,400
how could you do that?

463
00:33:31,440 --> 00:33:31,920
As you wish.

464
00:33:33,599 --> 00:33:34,880
It seems she agreed.

465
00:33:46,440 --> 00:33:47,839
It's a bit cold today.

466
00:33:48,880 --> 00:33:50,640
I heard the fur in Langyue is good.

467
00:33:51,279 --> 00:33:52,839
I'll buy a big one later.

468
00:33:55,799 --> 00:33:57,079
He's not content with sleeping on the ground.

469
00:33:57,279 --> 00:33:58,480
He doesn't want to stay at all.

470
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:14,960
Heartless,

471
00:34:15,039 --> 00:34:16,079
cold-hearted.

472
00:34:16,199 --> 00:34:17,320
He doesn't like me at all.

473
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:18,480
What's the point of asking?
